    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Document preparation: quoted, not listed here.</h2>
    <p style="font-size:16px;color:#39414B;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px">§ 2255 motions, § 2241 petitions, and compassionate release filings are not identical jobs wearing the same label. A 40-page record and a 4,000-page record are not the same project, and pricing them as if they were means either overcharging the simple case or underdoing the complicated one. We quote this work after the free review, once we know what the record actually contains — not before.</p>
    <p style="font-size:16px;color:#39414B;line-height:1.8">That said, you shouldn't have to guess blind. Here's the actual range our engagement pricing has run, from the current rate card:</p>
